0" end="00:16.490"><span begin="00:13.940" end="00:14.510">Yeah</span><span begin="00:14.510" end="00:14.510">,</span><span begin="00:14.510" end="00:14.750">their </span><span begin="00:14.750" end="00:15.200">broken </span><span begin="00:15.200" end="00:15.500">hearts </span><span begin="00:15.500" end="00:15.620">on </span><span begin="00:15.620" end="00:15.680">the </span><span begin="00:15.680" end="00:16.490">boulevard</span><span begin="00:16.490" end="00:16.490">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.490" end="00:21.680"><span begin="00:16.490" end="00:16.580">You </span><span begin="00:16.580" end="00:16.940">know </span><span begin="00:16.940" end="00:17.180">world </span><span begin="00:17.180" end="00:17.270">will </span><span begin="00:17.270" end="00:17.510">leave </span><span begin="00:17.510" end="00:17.570">you </span><span begin="00:17.570" end="00:18.230">scarred </span><span begin="00:18.230" end="00:18.350">and </span><span begin="00:18.350" end="00:18.890">let </span><span begin="00:18.890" end="00:19.040">you </span><span begin="00:19.040" end="00:20.090">down</span><span begin="00:20.090" end="00:21.680">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.680" end="00:28.430"><span begin="00:21.680" end="00:21.920">By </span><span begin="00:21.920" end="00:22.430">leaving </span><span begin="00:22.430" end="00:22.700">here </span><span begin="00:22.700" end="00:22.940">with </span><span begin="00:22.940" end="00:23.360">you</span><span begin="00:23.360" end="00:23.360">,</span><span begin="00:23.360" end="00:23.660">one </span><span begin="00:23.660" end="00:23.870">of </span><span begin="00:23.870" end="00:24.260">you </span><span begin="00:24.260" end="00:24.500">will </span><span begin="00:24.500" end="00:24.650">be </span><span begin="00:24.650" end="00:25.220">living </span><span begin="00:25.220" end="00:25.460">on </span><span begin="00:25.460" end="00:25.550">the </span><span begin="00:25.550" end="00:26.000">dark </span><span begin="00:2